# SITE5 (2026-08-18): /knowledge/wholesale-price-formation/ had a DIRECTORY and no entry in
# site/data/knowledge_wholesale.json, so the shared topic template rendered its own raw slug
# as the page title, with no blurb, no scope and no linked topics -- a published page that
# said nothing and named nothing. Nothing in the site linked to it and the Knowledge index
# never listed it, so it was reachable only by a crawler or a guessed URL.
#
# It is not written, because it is a DUPLICATE: its subject is exactly
# /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/, whose own title is "How Great Britain's wholesale
# electricity price is formed". Writing it would have produced two pages competing to explain
# one mechanism -- the warehousing mistake the brief objects to, in miniature.
#
# Redirected rather than deleted, per this file's own standing convention: the directory
# stays in-repo (noindex, unreachable canonically) for reference.
/knowledge/wholesale-price-formation /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/ 301
/knowledge/wholesale-price-formation/* /knowledge/electricity-wholesale/ 301
